tasks.instruction:
Design a TaqMan (5' nuclease) assay on this template. I want primers plus a hydrolysis probe between them, and I want the probe to sit at least a few degrees above the primers in Tm.

Template:
{template:400:7}

I need a qPCR assay that will NOT amplify contaminating genomic DNA. Here is the genomic sequence and the two exon coordinates — design a pair where the forward primer spans the exon-exon junction. Tell me the spliced amplicon size and how far apart the primers sit on the genome.

{seq:intron_genomic}

Exons: 1-400 and 701-1100 (1-based).
